{
    "title": "Generac PWRview",
    "description": "PWRview provides owners of a Generac energy system to see real-time site performance, directly from their mobile device.\r\n\r\nApp Features: \r\n\r\nUse Generac PWRview with your PWRcell system, your Generac generator with PWRview ATS, or with your PWRview Home Energy Monitor installation. PWRview gives you real-time insight into energy production, energy cost and consumption.\r\n\r\nLive energy monitoring \r\n\u2022 Monitor live home power consumption \r\n\u2022 PWRcell system owners can also monitor solar production and PWRcell battery capacity  \r\n\u2022 Understand your system behavior at a glance, with energy flow lines \r\n\u2022 See how your home energy needs have been met throughout the day \r\n \r\nDaily Energy Snapshot \r\n\u2022 Monitor your power consumption, and for PWRcell owners, also monitor your generation and battery usage throughout the day \r\n\u2022 Keep tabs on your daily system performance with aggregated energy measures \r\n\u2022 Understand how your solar system and energy storage help you reduce your daily grid energy demand \r\n \r\nHistoric Performance \r\n\u2022 Discover patterns in your consumption, solar generation, grid, and battery usage \r\n\u2022 Directly relate your system performance to your electricity bill \r\n \r\nBill Forecasting \r\n\u2022 Keep track of your spending by setting a budget and monitoring your costs to date\r\n\u2022 See how much you\u2019ve been saving daily with your solar production and battery usage",
